WHAT SHIPPED  (production-polished, Apple-idiomatic; no stubs / no skeleton-only / no scope-narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The SwiftUI parity of the web `KpiOverviewCard` — a presentational `GlassPanel` shell composing a
`ComparisonHeader` (title + current/comparison period strip + optional headline `Delta` + the web
`actions` slot), a responsive KPI grid of `MetricCard`-shaped tiles, an optional muted `secondary`
fold-down line, and an optional footer `InlineCallout`. It is the consistent shell every overview
surface (Drives / Charging / Trips / …) renders.

The native surface keeps that exact composition as the `content` phase and adds the P4 leaf contract
so it never collapses to a blank box. 9 files:
  KpiOverviewCard.swift            — the bound surface View (binds KpiOverviewCardModel; renders phase)
  KpiOverviewCard.Model.swift      — telemetry seam (P1/S11), i18n facade (P1/S10), Meta, Connection,
                                     the KPI value-types (Delta/Item/Callout/Header), Input, the
                                     @MainActor @Observable state-holder (P1/S8)
  KpiOverviewCard.Seams.swift      — Source protocol + Live + InMemory (P1/S8 seam)
  KpiOverviewCard.Projection.swift — pure snapshot→resolved projection (the data adapter) + a11y builders
  KpiOverviewCard.Views.swift      — header, grid, tile, secondary, footer callout, freshness chip
  KpiOverviewCard.States.swift     — loading skeleton grid, empty state, error+retry chrome
  KpiOverviewCard.Previews.swift   — #Preview for every state/composition (DEBUG)
  KpiOverviewCard.strings          — 15 native-chrome i18n keys (web source has 0 t() calls)
  KpiOverviewCard.Tests.swift      — 33 XCTest: projection per-state + model + source + a11y + compose

States rendered (all): loading (skeleton tiles) · empty (web EmptyState peer) · error (web QueryError
peer + retry) · content (header + grid + secondary + footer) · stale/offline (freshness chip in the
header with a one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition; last content stays visible).
Precedence: error > loading > empty(items.isEmpty) > content. The header always resolves so the panel
keeps its frame across every phase (the web card always renders ComparisonHeader).

Shared atoms reused (web GlassPanel → native): TSGlassPanel, TSDelta, TSSkeleton, TSEmptyState,
TSQueryError, TSTone, TSMetricValue + the P1/S9 tokens (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius). The
atoms TSKpiOverviewCard/TSKpi/TSComparisonHeader are the P4 component-library bundle (OUT OF SCOPE);
this surface is the bound, state-aware, telemetry-emitting shell named `KpiOverviewCard` (no collision
— all my public types are `KpiOverview*`-prefixed; verified collision-free in the SwiftPM build).
Telemetry: `view.opened` emitted exactly once with surface slug "KpiOverviewCard" (P1/S11).
Accessibility: tile label+value as one VoiceOver phrase, delta direction spoken, footer severity
prefix, freshness chip is a labelled refresh button, header title carries .isHeader, Dynamic-Type fonts,
Reduce-Motion honoured via TSSkeleton.

